    "Description": "IBM Java SE version 8 includes the IBM Java Runtime Environment and the IBM Java Software Development Kit.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* openjdk: Improve JMX connections (Oracle CPU 2026-01) (CVE-2026-21925)\n\n* openjdk: Improve HttpServer Request handling (Oracle CPU 2026-01) (CVE-2026-21933)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance Certificate Checking (Oracle CPU 2026-01) (CVE-2026-21945)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
